Question - 1 : Write a Python Program to prepare a Grade Checker with below details - Take a score as input and print the grade based on the following: 
90+ : “A”
80–89 : “B”
70–79 : “C”
60–69 : “D”
Below 60 : “F”
Use a basic if / else statement to determine the grade.

Source Code - 
=====================================================================================================================
Score = int(input("Please enter your score to find out your Grade\n"))
if Score >=90:
    print("Congratulations! You have got Grade - A")
elif Score >=80:
    print("Congratulations! You have got Grade - B")
elif Score >=70:
    print("Congratulations! You have got Grade - C")
elif Score >=60:
    print("Congratulations! You have got Grade - D")
else:
    print("You have got Grade - 'F', Try again and do better! All the very best!")


